      <section id="about" class="about-area">
                  <div class="container">
            <div class="row">
               <h1 class="section-name" style="color: #2c5f2d">About Shraddha Elite Project</h1>
               <div class="col-lg-7">
                  <div id="abt-text" class="abt-txt-area">
                     <p><strong>Shraddha Elite Borivali West</strong> is a project by <strong>Shraddha Developers &amp; Realtor</strong> situated in the most premium location of Borivali West, Kosamgo Nagar, behind Sumer Nagar, near S.V. Road and Jain Temple. It offers <strong>2 &amp; 3 BHK</strong> flats with the availability of Jodi Apartments. Also get Floor Plan, Price Sheet, RERA ID (P51800045452), Reviews, Possession Timeline, Construction Status, Location Advantages, Address, Amenities &amp; Specifications. Shraddha Developers Shraddha Elite Borivali West is an <strong>exclusive tower of G+32 storeys</strong>. Shraddha Developers &amp; Realtor Borivali West property features <strong>amenities</strong> like a cricket net with bowling machine, amphitheatre, jogging track, kids’ play area, gazebo sitting, toddler room, multipurpose indoor play area and party hall (table tennis, chess, carrom, foosball), multipurpose court (volleyball, basketball, badminton), banquet space with spillover lawn, dusk lounge at 108 meters high, fitness gym, meditation area on the 32nd floor above 100 meters, dedicated yoga area, and coffee lounge. Shraddha Elite Borivali West has excellent <strong>connectivity</strong> to Borivali Metro Station, Shimpoli Metro Station, S.V. Road, Don Bosco High School, and Reliance Mall.</p><p><strong>Borivali West</strong> is well-connected to Borivali Metro Station, Shimpoli Metro Station, S.V. Road, Jain Temple, and Apex Hospital.</p>                  </div>
                
               </div>
